# Overrides for tools/bench-idf.sh's build (build-bench/), on top of the
# project's sdkconfig. The script regenerates build-bench/sdkconfig from
# both whenever either changes.

# None today. The bench profiles (PROFILE_MODE PIN or GPIO) need GPIO48,
# which the Sidecar link uses for BCLK: the Sidecar is a CMake option
# (SIDECAR, off unless given), no longer an sdkconfig one.
